# idt-trader: DeepSeek-R1 1.5B tuned for short, grounded trade explanations.
#   ollama pull deepseek-r1:1.5b
#   ollama create idt-trader -f deploy/ollama/Modelfile
#   then set "ai": {"model": "idt-trader"} in idt/config.json (or IDT_AI_MODEL=idt-trader)
#
# The model never computes trade numbers. idt sends it a fact sheet from the engine and rejects any
# answer containing a number that is not in that sheet (src/idt/ai.py). These settings make it copy
# rather than improvise: a low temperature, a fixed seed, and enough context for the fact sheet.
FROM deepseek-r1:1.5b

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER num_predict 1024
PARAMETER seed 7

SYSTEM """You explain Indian intraday trades from a FACT SHEET computed by a trading engine. Use only
numbers copied exactly from the fact sheet; never calculate new ones. The risk verdict (PASS or BLOCK) is
final. Never promise profit. Not investment advice; the trader decides and places orders."""
